jbioemu2 is a JAX/Equinox translation of the BioEmu2 score model and EDM sampler
(https://github.com/microsoft/bioemu2, commit 06be369dd555849165a737472d42d936959e46fc),
Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation, licensed under the MIT License reproduced in LICENSE.
The translation is distributed under the same MIT License.

Third-party portions carried over from the BioEmu2 sources that were translated:

* BioMoA layers and operations, the atom attention encoder, contact conditioning, the
  dual-stream diffusion module, and the EDM sampler / rigid alignment contain portions
  adapted from Boltz (https://github.com/jwohlwend/boltz, v1.0.0 and commit
  b1ebfc46ecf57f5414e0d1a6f9027bbb122c53bc), licensed under the MIT License reproduced in
  licenses/LICENSE.BOLTZ-MIT. Copyright (c) 2024 Jeremy Wohlwend, Gabriele Corso, Saro Passaro.

* The quaternion-to-rotation helper used for random augmentation is adapted from PyTorch3D
  (https://github.com/facebookresearch/pytorch3d), licensed under the BSD License reproduced
  in licenses/LICENSE.PYTORCH3D-BSD. Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.

BioEmu2 model weights are downloaded from https://huggingface.co/microsoft/bioemu2 (MIT) and
are not redistributed here. Featurization, MSA search, and the optional `reference` extra
use the upstream BioEmu2 package and its own third-party notices.
